  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: position of the&nbsp;moving car at time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mtext>avg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mtext>avg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mtext>avg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>The instantaneous speed is given by:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>So, to get the point where average speed is equal to car&#39;s actual speed,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>avg</mtext></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
